{"s6770d01e7d15fe":"面包屑","s203c08e0d44ac3":"首页","s8a5edab2826324":"/","s7855e5e9727ea5":"博客","se2d4efa59baa78":"技术博客","s0e91474c2cf971":"2025.07.31","s5bdeab03be77f3":"HAMi 异构设备虚拟化之海光 DCU 实战：K8s 下的 vDCU 资源调度与纳管","s0e3d8855d6491c":"密","sc6e4b855eea2d7":"密瓜智能","sc36f8a800aae26":"发布团队","s2e312abf3b5bec":"复制原文链接","s84c713de6391c6":"HAMi 支持 DCU","s537a018b54b536":"技术原理 · 工程实践 · 开源洞察","sec7580fa3d47ab":"DYNAMIA · OPEN SOURCE & AI INFRASTRUCTURE","s3204e72644c402":"本文是分析海光 DCU 设备如何通过 HAMi 完成虚拟化，实现统一纳管与调度。","sff2fbf24e8af48":"本文目录 · 5 节","s3b2d0794ee6f67":"文章目录","s938db8c9f82c8c":"01","s19ab8064bfd8a5":"vDCU 基础操作","sa953f09a1b6b67":"02","s515b4b2e5cbeb2":"部署 HAMi","s0b8efa5a3bf104":"03","se4d1dad005a749":"部署设备插件","s6cd5b6e51936a4":"04","s4524ccea73d179":"vDCU 验证","sc97550ce8213ef":"05","sf159ae6ea5bdad":"关键实现","s2290eb7bb65a4d":"本文摘自：","s0328142c2be0af":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/gpyhltXK3CSTkwk4ZwD74A","s2a4c49f1f2b3dc":"之前通过一系列文章分析了 HAMI vGPU 部署使用以及背后的实现原理，本文则是分析海光 DCU 设备如何通过 HAMi 完成虚拟化，实现统一纳管与调度。","sd95fd931219754":"1. vDCU 相关命令","s2863e5da7e3df0":"在这之前简单过一下海光 DCU 自带的 vDCU 功能如何使用。","s720a9b7407627a":"1.1 查看物理 DCU 资源","sb04ab4f94acef2":"$ hy-smi virtual -show-device-info\n\nDevice 0:\n Actual Device: 0\n Compute units: 60\n Global memory: 34342961152 bytes\nDevice 1:\n Actual Device: 1\n Compute units: 60\n Global memory: 34342961152 bytes\n","s3288d6233708a1":"1.2 拆分 vDCU","se8ce059326a2ab":"拆分 DCU 为 4 份，分别包含 5，15，20，20 个计算单元以及 4096，8192，8192，8192MiB 的显存","s547b34e5f79c45":"$ hy-smi virtual -create-vdevices 4 -d 0 \\\n-vdevice-compute-units 5,15,20,20 \\\n-vdevice-memory-size 4096,8192,8192,8192\n\nThe virtual device is created successfully!\n","s4fefd290d09f83":"1.3 查看 vdcu 信息","s3f682e6bc0b769":"$ hy-smi virtual -show-vdevice-info\nVirtual Device 0:\n Actual Device: 7\n Compute units: 5\n Global memory: 4294967296 bytes\n- 5 -\nVirtual Device 1:\n Actual Device: 7\n Compute units: 15\n Global memory: 8589934592 bytes\nVirtual Device 2:\n Actual Device: 7\n Compute units: 20\n Global memory: 8589934592 bytes\nVirtual Device 3:\n Actual Device: 7\n Compute units: 20\n Global memory: 8589934592 bytes\n","sf9efef54e82984":"1.4 销毁 vDCU","s8472cda99c0142":"# -d ${dev_id} 指定物理 DCU ID，不指定则选定所有物理 DCU","sc831287e292975":"# -destroy-vdevice 销毁此物理 DCU 上所有 vDCU","sa30ccbb9a66376":"\nhy-smi virtual -d ","sa9ffd96a0601ff":"${dev_id}","s54b3181dddc16c":" -destroy-vdevice\n","sc2db14e8479fe0":"1.5 Docker 使用 vDCU","sbb67a1dfe55ad5":"在容器启动的时候执行以下命令将 vDCU 挂载至容器内。以下命令表示用户在启动容器时，挂载第 0 号 vDCU 实例。","sab59659ef78093":"docker run -it --name container_name \\\n--device=/dev/kfd \\\n--device=/dev/dri \\\n--device=/dev/mkfd \\\n-v /etc/vdev/vdev0.conf:/etc/vdev/docker/vdev0.conf:ro \\\n","sb2f3cde5172167":"${docker_image:tag}","s2b5eab8a02e74b":" \\\n/bin/bash\n","sbf13e6ed02bbd5":"可以看到除了通过 --device 方式挂载 kfd、dri、mkfd 等设备文件之外，还额外挂载了一个 /etc/vdev/vdev0.conf 文件到容器里。","s385b33bdf3327f":"实际上这个文件就是 vDCU 的配置文件，内部记录了该 vDCU 的详细信息。","s35b61c5ef58b6b":"虽然看不到相关源码，不过可以肯定的是，驱动程序肯定会查看该文件是否存在，如果存在则说明当前使用的是 vDCU，然后根据该文件中的信息来找到对应的物理 DCU，以及 core、mem 等信息以完成限制。","sc8d78774d60a4e":"接下来看下 HAMi 中如何使用 vDCU。","s639c6a5223da1f":"2.部署 HAMi","sd5c3242c4ea6d3":"前提条件：","sb7e0f00bf28e18":"dtk 驱动程序 >= 24.04","sc6b58bcb287c89":"2.1 部署","s281c8cd71f0953":"使用 Helm 部署","s8a96e0a972a089":"# 添加 repo","sa4074e6b6a640c":"\nhelm repo add hami-charts https://project-hami.github.io/HAMi/\n","se678db8e5fd085":"# 安装","sa83224eae8ca3b":"\nhelm install hami hami-charts/hami -n kube-system\n","seb8dc2b6da6f3c":"ps：可以通过调整 ","sedf0c7eb2d205b":"HAMi 部署配置","s34c3b8e8f7aed6":"来自定义你的安装。","s63e758f4fc541c":"如果当前环境无法拉取在线镜像，可以指定镜像仓库","sd46aee08cc49f6":"export","sc9fc092cfd4a35":" registry=192.168.10.172:5000\n","s86c4a2c81f6d76":"# 不指定 tag,会自动使用当前集群同样版本，需要确保 Registry 有该镜像","s8f687b10130f1a":" kubescheduler=","s272f343aa29a03":"$registry","s614cc4e13464f7":"/kube-scheduler\n\nhelm upgrade --install hami hami-charts/hami -n kube-system \\\n--","s6ee0eb490ff832":"set","sbfdb6565ff5fde":" scheduler.kubeScheduler.image=","secef426937e657":"$kubescheduler","s8112ea4bfca676":" \\\n--","sc542318bf9187b":" scheduler.extender.image=","s73106724f7e9c2":"/projecthami/hami \\\n--","s612258428bd20b":" scheduler.patch.imageNew=","s3a7fa6277b7f31":"/liangjw/kube-webhook-certgen:v1.1.1\n","s0ed5d60114dcbf":"2.2 检查 Pod 运行情况","s37ba5975058c44":"$ kubectl -n kube-system get po -l app.kubernetes.io/name=hami\nNAME                              READY   STATUS    RESTARTS   AGE\nhami-scheduler-6dbdf69644-mz9m5   2/2     Running   0          2m19s\n","s5fd20310ee616b":"如果 hami-scheduler Running 说明安装成功。","s618e0f94c88aff":"ps：对于 DCU 环境只会启动 hami-scheduler 一个 Pod。","s6f376a14745526":"3. 部署 hami-vdcu-device-plugin","sfcb3ff47b3c14d":"# 对应的 DevicePlugin 也是用 HAMi 社区提供的版本。","sf29b84f6aacc44":"# 先给 DCU 节点打上 label dcu=on","s8e23fd6665a66c":"\nkubectl label nodes {nodeid} dcu=on\n","s7a6d3b1a30e221":"3.1 准备工作","s929374c97d5703":"然后做以下准备工作","s9261e372e568d0":"创建 vdev 目录","sf91eaedfd858e8":"# on the dcu node, create these directory:","s493a4db2c28a55":"\n$ ","s95c5007a9af81a":"mkdir","s2af2272b93cc4a":" /etc/vdev\n","s7388a30c240897":"将 dtk 复制到 /opt/dtk 目录","scef1575259ed81":"因为容器会统一挂载 /opt/dtk，因此将其从部署目录 cp 到指定目录","s652dbf692b871a":"# should change dtk-xx.xx.x to your installed dtk version","se44b4bd707c540":"cp","s09b55e3cece6b3":" -r /opt/dtk-xx.xx.x /opt/dtk\n","s4159397b5c3164":"注意：/opt/dtk-xx.xx.x 这个位置取决于之前部署 DTK 时指定的目录","s1d592a46b6749a":"3.2 部署","sbc9f3fed5aa827":"然后就可以开始部署了","sacbb76a2b19d27":"从 ","sfc80caf86c8a69":"https://github.com/Project-HAMi/dcu-vgpu-device-plugin","s07fbb74cdd1a30":" 项目获取相关 yaml：","saae698234c8189":"wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Project-HAMi/dcu-vgpu-device-plugin/refs/heads/master/k8s-dcu-plugin.yaml\nwget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Project-HAMi/dcu-vgpu-device-plugin/refs/heads/master/k8s-dcu-rbac.yaml\n","s1b95e6b3ff63cb":"然后部署 device-plugin","s00b5a1b4f546f1":"kubectl apply -f k8s-dcu-rbac.yaml\nkubectl apply -f k8s-dcu-plugin.yaml\n","s7838b371839807":"3.3 检查 Pod 运行情况","s797816eed8489c":"确认相关组件都正常运行：","sd8153e0d7baa40":"$ kubectl get po -n kube-code\nNAMESPACE     NAME                                      READY   STATUS    RESTARTS   AGE\nkube-code     hami-dcu-vgpu-device-plugin-cgwwv        1/1     Running   4          14m\nkube-code     hami-dcu-vgpu-device-plugin-lp7gl        1/1     Running   0          8m36s\nkube-code     hami-dcu-vgpu-device-plugin-lswbl        1/1     Running   0          8m40s\nkube-code     hami-dcu-vgpu-device-plugin-svwl7        1/1     Running   0          8m38s\nkube-code     hami-scheduler-bb5586989-q7bvr           2/2     Running   0          54m\n","sd0e6fb5c32518b":"可以看到，几个 DCU 节点上的 dcu-vdcu-device-plugin 都运行正常。","s2b93ca180bb084":"至此，相关组件部署完成，接下来验证下 vDCU 能否正常使用了。","sf3957cb70da551":"4. 验证 vdcu","sdb84500035bc54":"4.1 查看 Node 资源","sbd67953f1cd852":"接下来就是查看节点资源情况，vdcu 是否正常注册。","s686fab4e8edc6e":"$ kubectl describe node d41gpucns41 | grep Capacity -A 8  \nCapacity:\n  cpu:                64\n  ephemeral-storage:  934609028Ki\n  hugepages-1Gi:      0\n  hugepages-2Mi:      0\n  hygon.com/dcu:      0\n  hygon.com/dcunum:   32\n  memory:             1043017856Ki\n  pods:               500\n","s28659a406f9c78":"这里的  hygon.com/dcunum:   32 就是 vdcu 数量，单节点 8 DCU，这里是做了 4 倍切分。","s994381a1ec6a3d":"ps: 因为当前一块海光物理 DCU 只支持切分为 4 个 vDCU。","s155274f78c1e5d":"4.2 启动 Pod 使用 vdcu","s26e50ac42350a6":"完整 yaml 如下：","s111d0e0c3c7afe":"apiVersion:","s3bfc269594ef64":"v1","s08863725c9d14a":"kind:","s0a6bb8b01de101":"Pod","s8c8c42289a1387":"metadata:","sd0d6d503f5acae":"name:","s2562e8738c499d":"alexnet-tf-gpu-pod-mem","sfa1e8330316fdd":"labels:","s6c7fc2130847a7":"purpose:","s115bd458691017":"demo-tf-amdgpu","s36184fa5172f39":"spec:","s04968f51ee0482":"containers:","s3973e022e93220":"-","s2e94c3d77b445f":"alexnet-tf-gpu-container","sa08a30338e824c":"image:","sd9ed447f601a42":"ubuntu:20.04","sae773d9b560702":"workingDir:","s94a6b447580330":"/root","s8ff7327fcdf50a":"command:","sc4ebc7684be8c9":" [","s0bb2388cc80f97":"\"sleep\"","s0a07f659461970":", ","s016ae398a67dbf":"\"infinity\"","s30348c92376d56":"]\n      ","scab2be2b3a2ed1":"resources:","s2629ac0e8d90da":"limits:","s83389c3b91ab78":"hygon.com/dcunum:","s6b86b273ff34fc":"1","s1d1aba1613848f":"# requesting a GPU","s54061bce2ee740":"hygon.com/dcumem:","s81a83544cf93c2":"2000","s74788a0708c6f9":"# each dcu require 2000 MiB device memory","s1e76f0d86a1472":"hygon.com/dcucores:","se629fa6598d732":"15","s8a6181c6cdcc5d":"# each dcu use 15% of total compute cores","s4d3611ce7e659b":"和 vGPU 类似，支持单独指定卡数、core、mem 等资源。","sb5279e5632d244":"进入 Pod 后先 source 下环境变量","s41cf6794ba4200":"source","s4c1e40a552d992":" /opt/hygondriver/env.sh\n","sa9f58a955ba202":"然后使用以下命令验证","s6c14b6f61ba02f":"hy-virtual -show-device-info\n","s0a3aabd969b702":"Device 0:\n        Actual Device: 0\n        Compute units: 9\n        Global memory: 2097152000 bytes\n","sa823ea4f11445d":"Compute units 和 Global memory 就是我们前面指定的 core 和 mem。","s47b992d7389f90":"至此，说明 HAMi vdcu 已经生效了。","s3000665999116d":"4.3 注意事项","sf5a9b57ae584df":"一些注意事项：","s31cac299411d4d":"如果您的镜像不是 'dtk-embedded-image'，则需要在任务运行后安装 pciutiils、libelf-dev、kmod，否则，像 hy-smi 或 hy-virtual 这样的 dcu 工具可能无法正常工作。","s1d7b3f62c7cb69":"不支持在 init 容器中共享 DCU，init 容器中带有 \"hygon.com/dcumem\" 的 pod 将永远不会被调度。","sc83c578829e99d":"每个容器只能获取一个 vdcu。如果您想挂载多个 dcu 设备，则不应设置 hygon.com/dcumem 或 hygon.com/dcucores。","s345fa8c506909c":"5. 实现分析","s6c2b0e1ab7babe":"简单分析一下 vdcu-device-plugin，根据第一章中使用 vDCU 的步骤可知，vdcu-device-plugin","s5945619e805d8f":"除了正常的上报设备信息，分配设备之外，还需要处理以下事情：","s1638a20c1c9424":"vDCU 配置文件维护","s432d325fd84326":"创建 Pod 时根据 yaml 中申请的 core、mem 生成对应的 vdcu 配置文件","s0a5bc8f2253f27":"Pod 删除后也需要删除对应的配置文件","s6a4eb7ec1f8c88":"挂载 vDCU 配置文件到 Pod 中","scd0d872413fd05":"只有这样驱动程序才知道将该 vDCU 限制在多少 core、mem","s642d8d373dae68":"推荐先看下这篇","s8b005e75027a19":"HAMi vGPU 方案原理分析 Part1：hami-device-plugin-nvidia 实现 device-plugin","s77f9d09edf4e7c":"实现上都是类似的。","s2c81226f7b6e50":"5.1 Register","s968cc4f9cd4118":"首先是要将 DevicePlugin 注册到 Kubelet，这